Appendix 4B – 2021 Half Year Results</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-ltd-interim-dividend-announcement-for-2021/">NGIP Agmark Ltd Interim Dividend Announcement for 2021</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-49th-annual-general-meeting/">NGIP AGMARK 49TH ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngp-disclosure-of-impact-of-covid-19/">NGP &#8211; Disclosure of Impact of Covid-19</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-appendix-4b-for-year-ended-31-december-2020/">NGIP AGMARK Appendix 4B for Year ended 31 December 2020</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngp-form-4b-statement-results-to-30-june-2020/">NGP: Appendix 4B &#8211; 2020 Half Year Results</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/update-ngp-agm-for-financial-year-2019/">Update: NGP AGM for Financial Year 2019</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/announcement-ngip-agmark-limited-2019-results-48th-agm/">Announcement: NGIP Agmark Limited 2019 Results &amp; 48th AGM</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-limited-announcement/">NGIP AGMARK LIMITED ANNOUNCEMENT</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngp-ngip-agmark-ltd-corporate-update/">NGP &#8211; NGIP AGMARK LTD CORPORATE UPDATE</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/company-announcement-form-4b-eofy-2019/">Company Announcement &#8211; FORM 4B EOFY 2019</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-limited-announces-john-nightingale-is-on-extended-medical-leave-steven-nightingale-is-appointed-as-chief-operating-officer/">NGIP AGMARK LIMITED ANNOUNCES JOHN NIGHTINGALE IS ON EXTENDED MEDICAL LEAVE &amp; STEVEN NIGHTINGALE IS APPOINTED AS CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-limited-appendix-4b-half-year-report-30-june-2019/">NGIP Agmark Limited &#8211; Appendix 4B Half Year Report – 30 June 2019</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngp-annual-report-2018-concise/">NGP: Annual Report [2018 Concise]</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-limited-appendix-4b-full-yearly-report-31-december-2018/">NGIP Agmark Limited &#8211; Appendix 4B Full Yearly Report – 31 December 2018</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-limited-appendix-4b-half-yearly-report-30-june-2018/">NGIP Agmark Limited &#8211; Appendix 4B Half Yearly Report &#8211; 30 June 2018</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-agmark-limited-annual-report-2017/">NGIP Agmark Limited: Annual Report 2017</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-appendix-4b-dec-31-2017/">NGIP &#8211; Appendix 4B &#8211; Dec 31 2017</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/annual-general-meeting-results-30-june-2017/">ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING RESULTS 30 JUNE 2017</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngp-appendix-4b-2016-preliminary-final-report/">NGP: Appendix 4B: 2016 Preliminary Final Report</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-appendix-4b-half-yearly-report/">NGIP: Appendix 4B &#8211; Half Yearly Report.</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/2016-agm-results/">NGIP AGMARK LIMITED 2016 AGM RESULTS</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pngx.com.pg/ngip-annual-report-2015/">NGIP: Annual Report 2015.</a></li></ul></div><h2 class="tabtitle">Company Overview</h2><div class="tabcontent"><table style="height: 790px;"><tbody><tr style="height: 22px;"><td style="height: 22px; width: 193px;"><strong>Company</strong></td><td style="height: 22px; width: 506px;">NGIP Agmark Limited</td></tr><tr style="height: 46px;"><td style="height: 46px; width: 193px;"><strong>Issuer Code</strong></td><td style="height: 46px; width: 506px;">NGP</td></tr><tr style="height: 22px;"><td style="height: 22px; width: 193px;"><strong>Industry </strong></td><td style="height: 22px; width: 506px;">Agriculture and Industrial</td></tr><tr style="height: 46px;"><td style="height: 46px; width: 193px;"><strong>Date Listed </strong></td><td style="height: 46px; width: 506px;">25/08/2009</td></tr><tr style="height: 70px;"><td style="height: 70px; width: 193px;"><strong>Foreign Exempt Entity </strong></td><td style="height: 70px; width: 506px;">No</td></tr><tr style="height: 166px;"><td style="height: 166px; width: 193px;"><strong>Overview:</strong></td><td style="height: 166px; width: 506px;"><strong>NGIP Agmark Ltd</strong> is a prominent leader in the agribusiness sector, providing comprehensive array of services and products to meet varied agricultural needs. Key offerings include:</p><ul><li><strong>Trading</strong>: Specialising in cocoa and coffee, maintaining quality from cultivation to market.</li><li><strong>Agricultural Supply Outlets</strong>: Offering essential retail supplies to enhance productivity.</li><li><strong>Commercial Agronomist Services</strong>: Providing expert advice to optimise crop yields.</li><li><strong>Engineering Services</strong>: Including slipway, precision machining, and metal fabrication, focusing on custom metal components across industries.</li><li><strong>Sales</strong>: Supplying machinery and spare parts.</li><li><strong>Integrated Shipping and Logistics</strong>: Encompassing coastal shipping, road, cartage, logistics management, and stevedoring for seamless supply chain operations.</li><li><strong>Property Portfolio Management</strong>: Managing assets to support and enhance core business activities.</li></ul></td></tr><tr style="height: 46px;"><td style="height: 46px; width: 193px;"><strong>Internet Address </strong></td><td style="height: 46px; width: 506px;"><a href="https://www.ngipagmark.com/">www.ngipagmark.com.pg</a></td></tr><tr style="height: 70px;"><td style="height: 70px; width: 193px;"><strong>Registered Office Address </strong></td><td style="height: 70px; width: 506px;">Level 1, NGIP Haus, Talina, Kokopo, Papua New Guinea</td></tr><tr style="height: 46px;"><td style="height: 46px; width: 193px;"><strong>Postal Address </strong></td><td style="height: 46px; width: 506px;">P0 Box 1921, Kokopo, Papua New Guinea</td></tr><tr style="height: 70px;"><td style="height: 70px; width: 193px;"><strong>Head Office Number </strong></td><td style="height: 70px; width: 506px;">+675 982 9055</td></tr><tr style="height: 70px;"><td style="height: 70px; width: 193px;"><strong>Head Office Facsimile </strong></td><td style="height: 70px; width: 506px;">+675 9829056</td></tr><tr style="height: 46px;"><td style="height: 46px; width: 193px;"><strong>Share Registry </strong></td><td style="height: 46px; width: 506px;">PNG Registries Limited, Level 2, AON Haus, P.O BOX 1265 Port Moresby, Papua New Guinea</td></tr><tr style="height: 70px;"><td style="height: 70px; width: 193px;"><strong>Share Registry Number<br /> </strong></td><td style="height: 70px; width: 506px;">+675 321 6377</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 style="text-align: left;"><strong>DIRECTORS/SENIOR MANAGEMENT </strong></h3><table style="width: 698px; height: 182px;"><tbody><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 486px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Nicholas Lyons</strong></td><td style="width: 212px; height: 24px;"><em>Chairman&amp; Director </em></td></tr><tr style="height: 24px;"><td style="width: 486px; height: 24px;"><strong>Mr. Steven Nightingale</strong></td><td style="width: 212px; height: 24px;">Managing Director</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 486px;"><strong>Mrs. Darrie Nightingale<br /> </strong></td><td style="width: 212px;">Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 486px;"><strong>Mr. Simon Kabiu</strong> <strong><br /> </strong></td><td style="width: 212px;">Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 486px;"><strong>Mr. Stanley Joyce </strong></td><td style="width: 212px;">Non-Executive Director</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 486px;"><strong>Mr. Warwick Lung</strong></td><td style="width: 212px;">Executive Director</td></tr><tr style="height: 56px;"><td style="width: 698px; height: 56px;" colspan="2"><h3><strong>Company Secretary </strong></h3></td></tr><tr style="height: 78px;"><td style="width: 486px; height: 78px;"><h6><strong>Mr. Junias Tamur </strong></h6></td><td style="width: 212px; height: 78px;">Company Secretary</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="sharedaddy sd-sharing-enabled"><div class="robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon sd-sharing"><h3 class="sd-title">Share this:</h3><div class="sd-content"><ul><li class="share-twitter"><a rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"
